[00:00.000] 作词 : Paul Simon
[00:00.000] 作曲 : Paul Simon

[00:02.500]Hello darkness my old friend
[00:02.500]你好 黑暗 我的老朋友
[00:07.570]l’ve come to talk with you again
[00:07.570]我又来和你交谈
[00:11.790]Because a vision softly creeping
[00:11.790]因为有一种幻觉正向悄悄地向我袭来
[00:16.800]left its seeds while I was sleeping
[00:16.800]在我熟睡的时候留下了它的种子
[00:21.280]And the vision
[00:21.280]这种幻觉
[00:23.520]that was planted in my brain
[00:23.520]在我的脑海里生根发芽
[00:28.200]Still remains
[00:28.200]缠绕着我
[00:31.320]within the sound of silence
[00:31.320]伴随着寂静的声音
[00:37.150]In restless dreams I walked alone
[00:37.150]在不安的梦幻中我独自行走
[00:42.000]narrow streets of cobblestone
[00:42.000]狭窄的鹅卵石街道
[00:46.500]Neath the halo of a street lamp
[00:46.500]在路灯的光环照耀下
[00:50.780]I turned my collar to the cold and damp
[00:50.780]我竖起衣领 抵御严寒和潮湿
[00:55.590]When my eyes were stabbed by the flash of a neon light
[00:55.590]一道耀眼的霓虹灯光 刺入我的眼睛
[01:02.290]That split the night
[01:02.290]它划破夜空
[01:05.490]and touched the sound of silence
[01:05.490]触摸着寂静的声音
[01:11.660]And in the naked light I saw
[01:11.660]在炫目的灯光下
[01:16.160]ten thousand people maybe more
[01:16.160]我看见成千上万的人
[01:20.350]People talking without speaking
[01:20.350]人们说而不言
[01:25.110]people hearing without listening
[01:25.110]听而不闻
[01:29.730]People writing songs
[01:29.730]人们创造歌曲却唱不出声来
[01:33.100]that voices never share No one dare 
[01:33.100]没有人敢
[01:40.450]disturb the sound of silence
[01:40.450]打扰这寂静的声音
[01:46.550]Fools said I you do not know 
[01:46.550]我说：傻瓜，难道你不知道 
[01:50.550]silence like a cancer grows
[01:50.550]寂静如同顽疾滋长
[01:55.580]Hear my words that I might teach you
[01:55.580]听我对你说的有益的话
[02:00.000]take my arms that I might reach you
[02:00.000]拉住我伸给你的手
[02:04.190]But my words like silent raindrops fell
[02:04.190]但是我的话犹如雨滴飘落
[02:13.280]And echoed in the wells of silence
[02:13.280]在寂静的水井中回响

[02:21.080]And the people bowed and prayed
[02:21.080]人们向自己创造的霓虹之神
[02:25.380]to the neon god they made
[02:25.380]神光中闪射出告诫的语句

[02:29.320]And the sign flashed out its warning
[02:29.320]在字里行间指明
[02:34.150]in the words that it was forming
[02:34.150]它告诉人们
[02:38.640]And the sign said the words of the prophets are
[02:38.640]预言者的话
[02:42.040]written on the subway walls and tenement halls
[02:42.040]都已写在地铁的墙上 和房屋的大厅里
[02:48.900]and whispered in the sounds of silence
[02:48.900]在寂静的声音里低语
